WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:02.000
Ah!

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.100
Eh? Who are you?

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.480
After I finally managed to track down your hideout,

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:13.200
I gathered my resolve and went to challenge each of you,

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.950
and you had the nerve to make a fool of me?!

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.990
Who is this girl? Eh, eh, eh?

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:01.570
I- I think you've got the wrong person...

00:02:01.570 --> 00:02:03.390
Hah? Feigning ignorance, huh?

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:12.630
I got the right person. Honda Tamaki, first year, class two. You were in the club room that time too.

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:14.150
Eh, um...

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:16.880
I won't forget it. It was last Saturday.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:22.120
I made my way through the club building under the evening light and opened your room's door.

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:25.720
By the way, there was some man carrying a delivery box.

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.300
But then...

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.960
Excuse me, I'd like to join this club...

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:32.040
Later!

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:35.030
I was driven out by a homely four-eyed girl.

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:38.510
But I saw it. You were in that room too.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:40.920
The girl that came to apply during that frenzy...

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:44.010
Sorry, I don't remember that very well...

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.260
What?

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:51.040
My big sister told me that you're a member of SNS Club.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:51.980
Sister?

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:56.130
Some Dead Fish... umm...

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:59.640
Some Dead Fish Eyes, Not Enough Sunlight, Shuttle Run Club.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:04.180
That's way too long, even though you're so short!

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:09.000
I-I grow two millimeters each year! And this year when my dad measured-

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.080
Ahh, that's not it!

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.460
Honda Tamaki, have a contest with me right now!

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:17.560
A-a contest?

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:22.970
I'm in the Illustration Club, but I can't set a bad example by letting the SNS club mock me!

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:25.400
Let's have a drawing duel!

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:30.140
That is my most beloved book. It was published by the Literature Club long ago.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:34.700
We'll both draw designs for the characters from one of the stories in it...

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:38.520
and see whose drawings are more fitting!

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:42.220
If I win, you'll hand over one copy of your game.

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:49.860
I hope that, little by little, we can get all sorts of people to play our club's works.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.380
I get the feeling we're better off giving it to her.

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:58.920
Wah, that'd be terrible!

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.240
What's with that lack of enthusiasm?

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.800
No, it's just...

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:06.540
I don't know how good you are at drawing,

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:10.720
but you had your senpai hold your hand all the way to finish your first work, right?

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.770
It's so much trouble to have no one who can draw.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.620
That's not...

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:19.400
They did help me, but I also practiced a lot on my own!

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:23.120
After all, you lived out in the middle of nowhere back in middle school.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:28.370
You only came here in high school, so I bet you're still not used to this new environment.

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:33.900
It's ain't nowhere. Tondabayashi ain't nowhere.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:37.560
Ah, sorry, I didn't mean to insult your hometown...

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.580
Whatever, it doesn't matter.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.260
You're saying that yourself?!

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:44.840
So, are you taking up the challenge or what?

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:50.680
I learned a lot about drawing from my senpai.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:54.140
For their sake too, I can't lose to this girl.

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:57.270
I accept!

00:04:58.120 --> 00:05:02.690
I thought so. I can't lose this challenge, you know.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:06.960
My life took a 180-degree turn after I found this book.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:10.740
I've been drawing for the sake of this day!

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.360
Eh? Huh?

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:18.000
I think I've seen that title somewhere...

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.460
I'll read it aloud.

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:26.300
"My name is Aya. I secretly fight mysterious fiends who seek to undermine this city.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:33.100
Rumors speak of me as Twinkle Star, the Priestess of Stardust who subjugates them.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:38.600
But I also sparkle like a star in my private life everyday.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:44.480
I recently got a boyfriend. But someone's been on my mind lately...

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:48.420
A man who shelters abandoned kittens under his umbrella...

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:49.800
Tokyun!

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:54.700
Why is my heart throbbing?
Even though I have a boyfriend!"

00:05:56.040 --> 00:06:01.020
It really is Seki-senpai's work after all! I get the feeling I shouldn't be reading this.

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:03.850
What's the matter? The best part's about to start.

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:06.010
A-are we drawing these characters?

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:06.660
Yup.

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:12.140
"After that day, the man with the umbrella, Baruta-san, and I got closer quickly.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:15.080
On a certain day, he invited me to an amusement park.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:18.440
But we unexpectedly ran into my boyfriend there.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:23.860
I didn't intend to cheat on him, but his eyes were already set far beyond the starry sky.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:28.980
'Aya, break up with him,' his words pierced me like meteors.

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:33.140
And just then, Baruta-san embraced me gently.

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:36.660
What should I do? Oh, Baruta-san, I-"

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:38.720
What's that supposed to be?

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:39.240
Huh?

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:43.180
Is that dull-faced girl with glasses the heroine?

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.580
Take this contest seriously.

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:47.480
Well, you see...

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:52.560
"Our happiness was short-lived, as the fiends attacked Earth again.

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:56.020
As the fight between Earth's defense forces and the fiends engulfed the town..."

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:00.880
No matter how many times I read it, it's still a masterpiece.

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:03.420
I'm so glad I was born.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:07.940
So, for the next challenge, are you finished with the boyfriend's design?

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:13.200
Not that you'd have a chance, seeing what you drew for the heroine.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:15.480
Huh?

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.870
What's with that serious look?

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:20.280
And that delicate drawing!

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:22.120
An... aging man?

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:27.980
C-could it be, Honda Tamaki, that you're drawing Baruta?

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:32.860
To have the guts to violate the terms of my challenge... I admire that.

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:38.100
No, those eyes... their passion pays no mind to petty challenges!

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:43.350
She's staking her all on her pencil lead!

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:46.990
And her very soul is being reflected on that page!

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:50.960
This is well beyond character design! That sense of motion! That zeal!

00:07:55.940 --> 00:07:56.950
I lost.

00:07:57.320 --> 00:07:57.840
Huh?

00:07:59.280 --> 00:07:59.950
Sorry?

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:03.260
I'll remember this, Honda Tama-!

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:05.440
Ow...

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:06.720
A-are you alright?

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:10.900
Stay away! I don't need an enemy's compassion.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:15.580
Someday, someday, all of you...

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:22.400
You can have this.

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:26.480
It's the game you made.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:31.360
Our president said she'd like many people to play it.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:42.820
Minaha.

00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:47.000
Minaha! That's my name!

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:51.920
This is not the end, you know!

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:11.140
It was a rainy night when Baruta-san said:

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:14.860
"I must go. My comrades are fighting"

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:16.340
I knew it...

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:18.180
Good morning, Honda-san!

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:20.300
Yes! Good morning!

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:23.580
It's starting to feel like summer, huh?

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:29.140
"O stars of destiny, what cruel games you play with us

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:32.700
'You were the Priestess of Stardust?'

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:37.280
Baruta-san's face filled with fear and astonishment when he saw Aya's breast.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:42.970
Aya stepped back from him, knowing that they were enemies. But..."

00:09:43.170 --> 00:09:47.440
I wish these cool days would last forever.

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:53.020
"Wait, Aya! Damned be your fate, let us..."

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:54.860
Run away!

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:55.720
Uh?

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:59.780
I'm sorry, Seki-senpai! I'm a bad girl!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.300
Honda-san?!

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:20.200
I have to give this book back. What class was that girl in again?

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:25.680
She mentioned an older sister. Maybe she's a senpai's younger sister?

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:28.960
If she's in middle school, I won't just run into her.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:34.420
So why's making a game so much trouble anyway?

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:35.820
You're asking that now?

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:40.760
If I could write a song and it just turned into a game, that'd be ideal.

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:42.980
That'd be too convenient.

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:54.960
How dare you... how dare you write such a bitter story that's making me weep uncontrollably!

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:59.940
I should have known Iris-sensei had written it!

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:04.340
Each sentence seemed to gently caress my heart.

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:09.380
And when I finally found my way to the true end...

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.900
Just then... just then...

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:15.740
It froze because of a bug!

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.580
Ahhhh!

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:21.440
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry,

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:25.700
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry...

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:37.320
This club has a website, right?

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:39.470
A simple one, yes.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:44.820
Since the game I got froze, I thought I'd see if there was a patch...

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:51.100
However! There wasn't even a list of works to begin with!

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:52.840
Who's the one who made it?

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:54.860
Her.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:58.260
I'm still learning how to make websites.

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:02.950
I thought showcasing our works on a shoddy website would do more harm than good.

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:06.460
Pull yourself together, President! It's a cool website!

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:11.160
Here's an updated copy where the bug's been fixed. Have this.

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:16.170
An update! Finally I can reach the true end!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:22.420
This cannot wait until I get home! Please, lend me a computer! I'll play it here.

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.700
Oh, then have my laptop.

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:26.140
Thank you very much!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:52.530
Thank you for your swift support! It is a wonderful production!

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.500
We're learning as we go.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.660
Her mood sure changes quickly.

00:12:56.660 --> 00:13:01.490
Thank you very much for your laptop! What did you contribute?

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:03.120
I did the music.

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:06.430
The music was also very good!

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:09.620
I did the illustrations!

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:10.920
You're no good.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:16.370
Iris-sensei's brilliant scenario completely overshadows your drawings.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.970
There isn't a single event picture.

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:21.820
E-event picture?

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:25.470
Don't tell me you don't know what that is?

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:30.160
I-I think I've heard it before. My senpai told me about it.

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:38.380
An event picture is a special picture that's shown during an in-game event.

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:41.380
Seriously, you don't even know the basics.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:45.360
It's like you think you just have to draw pictures and hand them in.

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:49.130
It's not like that...

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:56.390
Now, now. This is Honda-san's first time, after all. Won't you let her off the hook, for me?

00:13:56.570 --> 00:14:01.120
You're the one who drove me out back then, don't think I forgot.

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:05.410
Who're you anyway? Do you even have a talent? Are you just a debugger?

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:08.360
Whoa, that's so mean to debuggers!

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:13.100
Anyway, I'm in the Illustration Club, but it's feeling stale lately.

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:16.550
Then I remembered that I've been interested in the SNS Club for a while.

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:18.220
So that's why you came the other day.

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:22.520
Sorry our club member was so blunt.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:27.420
Not at all! I'm sorry I said such mean things.

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:31.340
Then how about joining us now?

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:34.740
It's reassuring to have people who can draw.

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:40.420
I so changed my mind just now. I bet you're luring me in to make me debug.

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:43.230
You have a terrible impression of debuggers.

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:46.780
Also, do you think it's fine to have this rude attitude with me?

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.760
It's you who showed me a rude attitude first.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:52.380
It's like two different people.

00:14:54.910 --> 00:15:01.360
During club PR, I couldn't approach you because Murakami-senpai was sleeping.

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:03.850
That was inexcusable of me.

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:06.380
It's not too late now though.

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:10.670
I think that girl is too mean to you.

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:13.140
I haven't given up yet.

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:18.490
Speaking of which, is Iris-sensei in this club too?

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:20.340
Um, well...

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:24.240
Could I get her signature next time she's...

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:40.900
Are you kidding me? You think the likes of you can take Iris-sensei's name just like that?

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:42.260
This is no good either...

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:47.060
I want to know more about the SNS Club members.

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:53.350
I know! Speaking of that website, how about updating it with an introduction of the members?

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:55.500
Sounds good, let's do it!

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:59.220
First, we'll need a portrait of each member.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.620
It's suddenly been decided...

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:04.260
Be grateful, Honda Tamaki.

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:10.130
Drawings are a website's face. I just gave you a chance to shine,

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:13.760
so prepare an interesting portrait and write up your introduction.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:33.960
An interesting portrait... an interesting portrait... um, an interesting portrait...

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:39.280
Are you trying to think of something? You won't get a good idea by making that troubled face.

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:43.770
In these situations, it's best to have a lot of fun.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:44.900
Have fun?

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:48.440
Yes.  Refresh and input, you know?

00:16:56.820 --> 00:17:00.560
Y-Yumine, this is a bit scary.

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:03.520
Isn't it wrong to come to such a place in a school uniform?

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:07.540
It's just an arcade. There isn't a rule against that.

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:38.510
Ah, today was fun!

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:41.200
I'm glad you could have fun.

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:46.080
So, what were you looking for ideas for? Your next project?

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:50.780
We decided to make interesting
self-introductions for our club's website.

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:56.800
I think these pictures are very interesting. Can I use them for my introduction?

00:17:56.800 --> 00:18:02.740
Why must you show my embarrassing poses to the whole world? Isn't it your introduction?

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:03.860
I thought so...

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:16.310
Keep at it, Tama-chan!

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:19.070
I guess it should be something that makes you want to click it...

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.200
Ah, it was a joke...

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.880
What happened, Yumine?

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:33.220
I saw this news story saying a voice actress I like was retiring,

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:37.840
but it was a trap that reels you in with the headline to make you feel hungry.

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:39.380
I fell for it...

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:41.660
That's it!

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:56.400
And so I got an idea from Yumine, and for my self-introduction's picture

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:58.440
I went with kinpira-style burdock!

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:11.720
Ah, um, it's really delicious! The trick is to add sesame oil at the end.

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:13.920
That's not the problem. It doesn't get the point across.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:19.920
You chose a picture of a beverage, Murakami-san.

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:22.660
Where do you find these?

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:27.040
My brother was sleeping on the sofa yesterday while making a funny face, so I sketched him.

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:29.760
Sketched? Is this supposed to be realistic?

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:34.380
But since I can't draw either, I chose a photograph and some lyrics.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:36.000
Let's see how it looks.

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:43.160
What sort of organization is this introducing?

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:52.420
As for me, I drew a picture based on your game yesterday, while my impression was fresh.

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:58.420
No matter how many times I read it, I'm always captivated by the heroine's emotions.

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.460
She's good.

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:04.120
Erm, we're happy that you drew that, but...

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:09.060
You're not a member, are you? Do you get an introduction page too?

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:13.300
How about you join now then?

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:14.150
I'm not joining!

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:19.770
In fact, Honda Tamaki, why didn't you draw a picture?

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:21.110
Erm, well...

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:23.820
How come the illustrator isn't putting in a drawing?

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:28.760
It's because I'm not as good at drawing as you.

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:30.740
You really are clueless...

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:37.500
Forget drawing. What if a person you love made you a birthday present?

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:44.680
Even if it were poorly made, wouldn't you be happy that they made it for you?

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:49.620
A handmade present from Papa!

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:51.120
You're too sappy!

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:53.350
All right, I'll draw!

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:56.810
I'll draw lots of pictures to put on our website!

00:20:57.120 --> 00:20:58.520
That's the spirit.

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:02.520
I too must practice until my work is worth showing Iris-sensei.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:08.780
And then I'll revive Sensei's past work, Stardust Intenzione, with my illustrations!

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:13.300
Well then, goodbye. Send my regards to Iris-sensei.

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:24.200
I think it'd be better not to reveal my identity at this point.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:26.480
It's your dark history, after all.

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:30.960
So who was that girl in the end? She didn't introduce herself.

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:34.320
Minaha-chan appeared suddenly.

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:39.780
I think she may be in middle school, but I don't know her family name or grade yet.

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:44.680
All I know is that she's better than me at drawing.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:47.820
What will happen next, I wonder?

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:24.500
I mean, when I draw...

00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:26.380
What are you doing to Tama-chan?!

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:27.760
Are you Iris-sensei?

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:28.670
Wait a minute!

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:33.010
Would you still be my president?
